&lt;p&gt;Cecconi&#39;s is Amsterdam&#39;s go-to for Italian dining: great food, great wine, great energy. We&#39;re looking for professional waiters who take pride in the details and love making guests feel like the most important person in the room.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
