&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€2,511 - €2,711 gross per month for a full-time contract (part-time pro rata), plus tips&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Staff meals / uniform / holiday pay / pension / travel allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training in Italian wine, menu and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team that&#39;s serious about the craft and still has fun&lt;/li&gt;
